      "ChildGraph": null,
      "Parameters": [
        {
          "Id": "text",
          "Type": "string",
          "Value": "GpuFluidVelocity · Fluid2D VelocityOutput → GPU particles\nThe smoke solver runs first. Its velocity moves the particles; its plane is hidden.\n64 × 64 cells; 100 particles per second. Preview: 60 FPS, frames 0–600.\nフルイドの速度を粒子が読み取ります。対応する GPU 接続先で確認してください。"
        },
        {
          "Id": "width",
          "Type": "float",
          "Value": 680
